                <li><a href="College.html">College</a></li>
                <li><a href="Contact.html">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="welcome-banner">
            <div class="banner-content">
                <h2>Philippine Technological Institute of Science Arts and Trade</h2>
                <p class="school-quote">"Global Success Through Academic Excellence"</p>
                <a href="enrollment form.html" class="enroll-btn">Enroll Now</a>
            </div>
        </section>
        


    <main>
        <section class="College-Courses">
            <div class="College-Courses-banner">
                <h2>COLLEGE COURSES</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="College-Courses-Content">
              <p class="bscs-quote">BACHELOR OF SCIENCE IN COMPUTER SCIENCE<br />
                <br />
                Our Program Equips Students with the Skills Needed for Thriving Careers in Computer Science. From Programming to AI, our Comprehensive Curriculum Covers it all. Gain Practical Experience Through Projects and Internships, Preparing you for Software Development, Data Analysis, and IT Consulting Role.</p>
              <p class="bsoa-quote">BACHELOR OF SCIENCE IN OFFICE ADMINISTRATION<br />
                <br />
                It Focuses on Both, Theoretical Understanding of Teaching and Practical Competencies in this Field. Graduates can Become Effective Educators in Areas such as Culinary, Arts, Restaurant Operations, Food Safety, Business Management, and Customer Service.</p>
              <p class="btvted-quote">BACHELOR OF SCIENCE IN TOURISM AND HOTEL MANAGEMENT<br />
                <br />
                Graduates of this Program are Equipped to Perform a Wide Variety of Administrative Tasks, Including Clerical Duties, Personnel Management, Events Coordination, and Customer Service.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

</body>

